<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Essence Boost -->
  <Weazel_EssenceBoost.label>精华增幅剂</Weazel_EssenceBoost.label>
  <!-- EN: A combat drug that remakes go-juice the Weazel way. It is barely addictive, yet it sharpens consciousness and manipulation and helps the user endure pain.\n\nDrugs made to human standards are all too often lethal to the Weazels' small bodies. Through countless battles and endless trial and error, the Weazels finally succeeded in brewing a combat drug suited to themselves. Essence Boost is often used like a quick vape before getting down to business. This monstrous drug, which gained a measure of safety against addiction while keeping its full effect, turns the Weazel who takes it into a frenzied little weasel for a while. -->
  <Weazel_EssenceBoost.description>用鼬族的方式重新调制能量果饮而成的战斗药物。它几乎不会成瘾，却能提升意识与操作能力，并帮助使用者忍受疼痛。\n\n按人类标准制造的药物，对鼬族娇小的身体来说常常是致命的。历经无数场战斗与没完没了的试错，鼬族终于成功调制出适合自己的战斗药物。精华增幅剂常被拿来像办正事前先快速吸一口电子烟那样使用。这种怪物级的药物在保有完整药效的同时，也取得了一定程度的成瘾安全性，会让使用的鼬族暂时变成一只狂暴的小鼬鼠。</Weazel_EssenceBoost.description>
  <!-- EN: Inhale {0} -->
  <Weazel_EssenceBoost.ingestible.ingestCommandString>吸食{0}</Weazel_EssenceBoost.ingestible.ingestCommandString>
